        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_83ea28340f6e435ca9b7cb0ec391c340",
      "statement": "Model weights are baked into the image at build time by get_models.sh in a RUN layer and are not stored in any volume, so updating YOLO or face models requires rebuilding the image; the named volumes only hold runtime-persistent face reference images and unknown-face crops.",
