    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e91429917a5943ff948629ffacbc35bc",
      "statement": "The MQTT broker is a separately built mosquitto image (Dockerfile.mosquitto from eclipse-mosquitto:latest) whose entrypoint generates mosquitto.conf (listener 1883, password_file, persistence under /mosquitto/data) and creates credentials with mosquitto_passwd from MQTT_USER/MQTT_PASSWORD; the compose override exposes 1883/9001 and maps ZoneMinder's ports to host 7080/7000.",
